From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibreTag <dev@libretag.invalid>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:07:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/50] LibreTag tracker role

Tracker main loop (src/main_tracker.cpp), platform hooks for lt_core, tracker.conf,
USB PID 0x0007 "LibreTag Tracker", GPS manager gps_stop_acquiring(), LoRa radio
override and RX helpers. See the LibreTag repository, SPEC.md and PROTOCOL.md.
