+	bool "LibreTag tracker (sleeping GPS tracker, encrypted reports)"
+	help
+	  LibreTag: wakes up periodically, gets a GNSS fix, floods one
+	  encrypted location report (PROTOCOL.md in the LibreTag repo),
+	  listens briefly for a command and goes back to sleep. No mesh
+	  identity, no adverts, no forwarding. Text CLI on USB CDC-ACM.
+
